# `services/api/migrations/` is read-only

Do not edit. Full workflow: `.cursor/rules/14-no-handwritten-migrations.mdc`

```bash
task schema:diff -- <name>   # pg-schema-diff → goose migration
task migrate                 # goose apply at dev/startup
```
